{"sample_id": "vidscamnet:R6f0psoLpGw", "dataset_id": "vidscamnet", "video_id": "R6f0psoLpGw", "title": "VIVIAN HAS A PANERA REWARDS CARD!", "description": "Vanessa is rich. That's all you need to know.", "asr": {"language": "en", "full_text": "Let me tell you something. I am rich. How do I know I'm rich? Because I have a Panera Rewards card. You're still eating at McDonald's. Still getting four for fours. I'm at Panera. Earning my rewards all the way to the top. I'm rich. When you get a Panera Rewards card,. You're in the upper financial bracket. You understand what I'm saying? When I go to Target,. Or JCPenney or any of those other fancy places, I tell them, charge it to my Panera. They don't do it, but it's the mindset. I'm rich. I eat egg white and avocado on wheat. For breakfast. That is rich people's breakfast. Rich.", "segments": []}, "frames": [{"frame_id": "F0001", "file": "frames/000001.jpg", "sha256": "0ce5b3b3695c2c79c19dc89aa7ee18d30ab974221aa790379a2d9a6b6f8fcef1"}, {"frame_id": "F0002", "file": "frames/000002.jpg", "sha256": "90e89d47ce5721db6030abe16e3e7de31a4b7b007a9f916dd9bd59f3969ed42d"}, {"frame_id": "F0003", "file": "frames/000003.jpg", "sha256": "be5da848ce70295c064d8e7d8e867a2984cd31b3c71b8a9b617771b5d1b932fe"}, {"frame_id": "F0004", "file": "frames/000004.jpg", "sha256": "9f7e5c9a53a10cd728605f970425e9ca8dedcb0963908d3375ee2d71a3bc369c"}, {"frame_id": "F0005", "file": "frames/000005.jpg", "sha256": "6db34cf4f165bdaa5b5b2c05bcc7868c53a9adec318188bd08dea7860b880d45"}, {"frame_id": "F0006", "file": "frames/000006.jpg", "sha256": "2becebd3e2f1361e577bb2311d3c7b598d4d044985864499ccf266376db2454c"}, {"frame_id": "F0007", "file": "frames/000007.jpg", "sha256": "96d991736a72daecccdf4f9a448b8f5c8e0087f70ed796c5b93583c0bad4edf6"}, {"frame_id": "F0008", "file": "frames/000008.jpg", "sha256": "097b8c9e40735d92f39d665cd96e595a7e2ad1e878bc64f39c46176c6dbc258a"}, {"frame_id": "F0009", "file": "frames/000009.jpg", "sha256": "864bb9446a992a409f0745ee39041fec7