", "F0040", "F0044", "F0049", "F0054"], "label_evidence": ["F0001", "F0006", "F0011", "F0015", "F0020", "F0025", "F0030", "F0035", "F0040", "F0044", "F0049", "F0054"]}, "text_sources": {"potential_elements": [{"source_id": "TITLE_0001", "kind": "TITLE", "text": "VIVIAN HAS A PANERA REWARDS CARD!", "location": {"field": "title", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "offset_basis": "whitespace_normalized"}}, {"source_id": "DESCRIPTION_0001", "kind": "DESCRIPTION", "text": "Vanessa is rich. That's all you need to know.", "location": {"field": "description", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 45, "offset_basis": "whitespace_normalized"}}, {"source_id": "ASR_0001", "kind": "ASR", "text": "Let me tell you something. I am rich. How do I know I'm rich? Because I have a Panera Rewards card. You're still eating at McDonald's. Still getting four for fours. I'm at Panera. Earning my rewards all the way to the top. I'm rich. When you get a Panera Rewards card,. You're in the upper financial bracket. You understand what I'm saying? When I go to Target,. Or JCPenney or any of those other fancy places, I tell them, charge it to my Panera. They don't do it, but it's the mindset. I'm rich. I eat egg white and avocado on wheat. For breakfast. That is rich people's breakfast. Rich.", "location": {"field": "full_text", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 589, "offset_basis": "whitespace_normalized"}}], "label_evidence": [{"source_id": "TITLE_0001", "kind": "TITLE", "text": "VIVIAN HAS A PANERA REWARDS CARD!", "location": {"field": "title", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "offset_basis": "whitespace_normalized"}}, {"source_id": "DESCRIPTION_0001", "kind": "DESCRIPTION", "text": "Vanessa is rich. That's all you need to know.", "location": {"field": "description", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 45, "offset_basis": "whitespace_normalized"}}, {"source_id": "ASR_0001", "kind": "ASR", "text": "Let me tell you something. I am rich. How do I know I'm rich? Because I have a Panera Rewards card. You're still eating at McDonald's. Still getting four for fours. I'm at Panera. Earning my rewards all the way to the top. I'm rich. When you get a Panera Rewards card,. You're in the upper financial bracket. You understand what I'm saying? When I go to Target,. Or JCPenney or any of those other fancy places, I tell them, charge it to my Panera. They don't do it, but it's the mindset. I'm rich. I eat egg white and avocado on wheat. For breakfast. That is rich people's breakfast. Rich.", "location": {"field": "full_text", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 589, "offset_basis": "whitespace_normalized"}}]}, "potential_elements": {"textual": [], "visual": [], "textual_context_notes": [], "visual_context_notes": []}, "annotation": {"binary_label": "Non-scam", "primary_subtype": "N06", "content_role": "discussion_or_education", "contextual_rationale": "This video is non-scam content because it presents a comedic monologue about treating a Panera rewards card, upscale food references, and restaurant comparisons as markers of being \"rich.\" The statement that purchases cannot actually be charged to Panera frames the charging claim as humor rather than a financial mechanism. No request for payment, private data, investment participation, or other scam solicitation is described.", "fine_grained_rationale": "The central context is general lifestyle entertainment and comedy: the speaker exaggerates the status associated with a rewards card, restaurant choices and breakfast rather than presenting a scam mechanism or soliciting participation.", "evidence": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "observation": "The speaker links having a Panera Rewards card with her claim that she is rich.", "source_id": "ASR_0001", "quote": "Because I have a Panera Rewards card."}, {"evidence_id": "E002", "observation": "The speaker states that stores do not actually charge purchases to the Panera card and frames the claim as a mindset.", "source_id": "ASR_0001", "quote": "They don't do it, but it's the mindset."}, {"evidence_id": "E003", "observation": "The speaker uses a breakfast choice as part of the exaggerated lifestyle-comedy framing.", "source_id": "ASR_0001", "quote": "I eat egg white and avocado on wheat. For breakfast. That is rich people's breakfast."}, {"evidence_id": "E004", "observation": "A woman is visibly speaking directly to the camera in a plain indoor setting.", "source_id": "F0001", "quote": ""}]}}
